{"version":1,"key":"card:451","content":{"id":451,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以使用比较表达式产生布尔值"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_991b6fe4-5578-4675-b6fe-c835c9ecee91.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Python 也支持链式比较：可同时使用多个比较运算符，如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0 < age < 100","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> age = 90\n>>> 18 < age < 35\nFalse\n>>> 0 < age < 100\nTrue","language":"py","uuid":"7e9a7e36-d0d0-4a83-9e7f-bd9bca1e0f10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"==","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于值的比较"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"a = [1, 2]\nb = [1, 2]\n\na == b # True","language":"py","uuid":"ffbbd611-7315-4bbc-9e9e-fc290937c342","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"is","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 比较是否是同一个对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"x = 1\ny = 2\n\nx is y # False\n\ny = x\nx is y # True\n\na = [1, 2]\nb = [1, 2]\n\na is b # False","language":"py","uuid":"9ec9ae02-489a-46a3-933e-8d2407ef4ae4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"in","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 成员资格运算符"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"name = input('What is your name?')\nif 's' in name:\n    print('Your name contains the letter \"s\".')\nelse:\n    print('Your name does not contain the letter \"s\".'","language":"py","uuid":"0b4b0dbb-00c2-46b2-bbb7-ef8ebb75cbf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"字符串和序列的比较","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据字符的字母排列顺序进行比较"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> \"alpha\" < \"beta\"\nTrue","language":"py","uuid":"525c14ba-7482-4286-8913-78abc17681bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他序列的比较方式与此相同，但这些序列包含的元素可能不是字符，而是其他类型的值。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> [1, 2] < [2, 1]\nTrue","language":"py","uuid":"2d0b9e8c-7e63-4360-b6c7-5067a68d4cfd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Python"],"createTime":1719188751725,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}